<title>UK: Salomon Brothers set warrants on the DAX index.</title>
<headline>Salomon Brothers set warrants on the DAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers AG says it has issued 100 million call and put warrants, in 10 equal tranches, on the DAX index.</p>
<p>100 warrants control one index.</p>
<p> WARRANTS   STRIKE	 ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	 GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A     3,400.00     2.27 DEM	8.59 PCT     14.71 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B     3,500.00     1.81 DEM     10.21 PCT     18.45 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C     3,600.00     1.39 DEM     11.95 PCT     24.03 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL D     3,700.00     1.04 DEM     13.89 PCT     32.12 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL E     3,800.00     0.76 DEM     16.05 PCT     43.95 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT F	3,000.00     0.92 DEM     12.93 PCT     36.30 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT G	3,100.00     1.14 DEM     10.60 PCT     29.30 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT H	3,200.00     1.45 DEM	8.53 PCT     23.03 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT I	3,300.00     1.83 DEM	6.68 PCT     18.25 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT J	3,400.00     2.26 DEM	4.97 PCT     14.78 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.MAR.97-19.DEC.97   PAYDATE	26.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT STG DDF	     MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  3,340.00</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
